Canonical website:
  https://launchpad.net/dee

Canonical download:
  https://launchpad.net/dee/1.0/1.2.7/+download/dee-1.2.7.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack dee-1.2.7-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./dee-1.2.7-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/dee-1.2.7-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/dee-1.2.7-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libdee1.0_4-1.2.7-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libdee1.0-devel-1.2.7-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/girepository-Dee1.0-1.2.7-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/python312-dee-1.2.7-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/vala-dee1.0-1.2.7-X.tar.xz

